ian by one cent. Barrett is not good at this. Barrett is lucky at this."},{"team_id":"4","team_key":"scrape.l.675504.t.4","score":0.6473,"all_play":"23-16","all_play_pct":0.5897,"luck_index":1.231,"recent_form":0.582,"efficiency":95.4,"regret":5.8,"prev_rank":4,"rank":5,"movement":-1,"blurb":"Undefeated for three weeks and then undone by a single penny. The best lineup needed one swap worth 5.80. Nathan needed 0.02. The accountant finally missed a decimal."},{"team_id":"1","team_key":"scrape.l.675504.t.1","score":0.632,"all_play":"25-14","all_play_pct":0.641,"luck_index":0.077,"recent_form":0.5898,"efficiency":87.0,"regret":18.22,"prev_rank":6,"rank":6,"movement":0,"blurb":"Started the wrong quarterback for the third straight week and won anyway, by 0.46. Three quarterbacks, three weeks, zero correct starts. The commissioner is on a streak."},{"team_id":"8","team_key":"scrape.l.675504.t.8","score":0.5968,"all_play":"22-17","all_play_pct":0.5641,"luck_index":-0.692,"recent_form":1.0,"efficiency":90.5,"regret":15.46,"prev_rank":10,"rank":7,"movement":3,"blurb":"Scored the most points in the league and benched the defense that outscored his starting defense for the second week running. Up three spots. The Vikings would like to be considered."},{"team_id":"14","team_key":"scrape.l.675504.t.14","score":0.4109,"all_play":"13-26","all_play_pct":0.3333,"luck_index":1.999,"recent_form":0.5237,"efficiency":92.2,"regret":9.92,"prev_rank":8,"rank":8,"movement":0,"blurb":"3-0 against his opponents, 0-3 against the median, 21 moves, one kicker who scored exactly 2.00. Greg has beaten everybody he has played and lost to a number every single week."},{"team_id":"13","team_key":"scrape.l.675504.t.13","score":0.3397,"all_play":"15-24","all_play_pct":0.3846,"luck_index":-0.154,"recent_form":0.5872,"efficiency":89.5,"regret":14.2,"prev_rank":14,"rank":9,"movement":5,"blurb":"Up five spots for his first head-to-head win, earned while starting a player projected for zero who scored zero.